{"ready":true,"data":{"id":"adetokumboh-m-cormack","name":"Adetokumboh M'Cormack","birthDate":"1982-02-27","birthPlace":"Sierra Leone","bio":"Frederick Adetokumboh M'Cormack (sometimes credited as Adetokumboh McCormack, Frederick McCormack, or Adetokumoh McCormack) is a Sierra Leone Creole actor, known for his roles in the television series Lost and Heroes.\n\nMcCormack was born in Sierra Leone. He lived in Nigeria and Kenya before attending SUNY Purchase in New York. He currently resides in Los Angeles.\n\nHe has appeared in numerous TV-series, and he portrayed a recurring character on Lost as Mr. Eko's deceased brother, Yemi. He also portrays the recurring role of Tuko on Heroes. He played Zeze Eto'o in 24, starring Kiefer Sutherland in season 7, episodes 4 and 5.\n\nHis first feature film was the Academy award-nominated Blood Diamond (2006), starring Leonardo DiCaprio, Jennifer Connelly and Djimon Hounsou.\n\nFrom Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia","source":"TMDB","fetchedAt":"2026-11-16T12:12:00+00:00","tmdbId":208096,"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/208096","credits":[{"id":"cap-winter","title":"Captain America: The Winter Soldier","character":"French Radio Pirate"}],"photo":"./public-data/images/people/adetokumboh-m-cormack.webp","filmography":[{"name":"X-Men '97","year":2024,"character":"En Sabah Nur (voice)","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/2HKBc5UiFw8JrruHq8S1Y7TnlW0.jpg"},{"name":"Do Not Watch","year":2023,"character":"Squires","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/zyLmhUnltbCfVekf9Q8bxQbwL5M.jpg"},{"name":"A Dark Way Out","year":2023,"character":"Sebastian","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/2ABNDmyBwhZ0Tl6zMP4qGoFX41A.jpg"},{"name":"Curses!","year":2023,"character":"Mwenda (voice)","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/sB0pjty0yMjCXJG0X2I8zu8fM57.jpg"},{"name":"Los Angeles","year":2021,"character":"Bruce","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://im